cmd_replay() {
  # Inventory of paid `.action` BUTTON handlers and the guard each carries
  # against a stale-persistent-button replay: re-tapping a button on an old
  # message re-runs a completed paid op (upscale_image #1551, ai_photoshop_-
  # upscale_last #1553, upscale_neurophoto_image (iter213) -- all found this way).
  # For each handler that fires a charge directly, prints CONSUME-GUARDED /
  # LEAVE-GUARDED / INFLIGHT-ONLY / UNGUARDED. INVENTORY, never a gate (exit 0):
  # a "review" hint is heuristic -- a handler is safe if its target changes each
  # tap (fresh upload). Read each flagged handler; the in-flight flag alone does
